  'Your agent uploads over HTTPS from its own environment. No SSH, browser login, or cookies are needed. This command contains your current token. Update the local file path before running it.' => 'Agent 在自己的环境中通过 HTTPS 上传，无需 SSH、网页登录或 Cookie。以下命令已填入当前真实 token。修改本地文件路径后即可执行。',
