  'curl command' => 'curl 命令',
  'Copy SKILL.md' => '复制 SKILL.md',
  'Copy this content into personal-opds-upload/SKILL.md for your agent. It includes the current token, selected category, endpoint, and upload instructions. The skill is written in English.' => '将以下内容复制并保存为 personal-opds-upload/SKILL.md，即可交给 Agent 使用。已包含当前 token、所选分类、上传地址和完整说明，技能内容使用英文。',
  'Copied' => '已复制',
  'HTTP parameters, batch uploads, and responses' => 'HTTP 参数、批量上传和返回结果',
  'POST to this installation\'s api.php with Authorization: Bearer TOKEN. The multipart form requires directory (a category name) and files[] (files). Tokens are accepted only in the header, never in URLs or form fields.' => 'POST 到本站 api.php。请求头为 Authorization: Bearer TOKEN；multipart 表单必须包含 directory（直接子目录名）和 files[]（文件）。Token 只接受请求头，不能放在 URL 或表单中。',
  'Requires curl 7.76+. For multiple files, repeat' => '需要 curl 7.76+。多文件时，重复添加',
  '. Each file is limited to 100 MiB; a request accepts up to 20 files and 200 MiB total. Existing files are never overwritten.' => '。单文件不超过 100 MiB；每请求最多 20 个文件、合计 200 MiB。同名文件返回错误，始终不覆盖。',
  'directory uses --form-string so category names are treated as literal text. The server validates filenames and destinations independently of the selection list.' => 'directory 使用 --form-string，确保目录名被当作普通文本。文件名和目标目录仍由服务端校验。网页中的目录列表仅用于选择。',
  '{"success":true,"message":"Saved: article.epub","results":[{"name":"article.epub","success":true,"message":"Saved: article.epub","status":200}]}' => '{"success":true,"message":"已保存：article.epub","results":[{"name":"article.epub","success":true,"message":"已保存：article.epub","status":200}]}',
  'All saved: HTTP 200. Invalid parameters: 400; invalid token: 401; duplicate: 409; too large: 413; unsupported request type: 415; validation or partial failure: 422; rate/concurrency limit: 429. Internal errors return 5xx. See results for individual files. Partial success is preserved and curl exits with a nonzero status.' => '全部成功：HTTP 200。无效参数：400；token 无效：401；同名：409；大小超限：413；格式不支持：415；内容校验或部分失败：422；限速或并发已满：429。内部故障返回 5xx。逐文件结果见 results；部分成功不会回滚，curl 会以非零状态退出。',
  'After 100% transfer, wait for server validation and saving. Check the library before retrying an interrupted request. This command contains credentials: share it only with agents that need upload access, and keep it out of public logs and repositories.' => '传输 100% 后仍需等待服务器校验和保存。网络中断时先检查书库，勿盲目重传。命令包含上传凭据，只交给需要上传权限的 Agent；避免进入公开日志或代码仓库。',
  'Copied.' => '已复制。',
  'Automatic copying was blocked. The content is selected; copy it manually.' => '浏览器未允许自动复制，内容已选中，请手动复制。',
