  'Set your library name, upload password, and categories. Application files, configuration, cache, and the installation lock are generated automatically. Different existing files are never overwritten.' => '只需设置书库名称、上传密码和分类。程序文件、配置、缓存和安装锁会自动生成；已有不同内容的文件不会被覆盖。',
