  'Initial categories (one per line)' => '初始分类（每行一个）',
  'Check and install' => '检查并安装',
  'Server configuration and directory protection' => '服务器配置与目录保护',
  'The installer writes conf/.htaccess for Apache, which must allow it to take effect. With Nginx, deny HTTP access to this installation\'s conf directory. Example for /opds/:' => '安装器会生成 Apache 的 conf/.htaccess（需服务器允许其生效）。Nginx 需在站点配置中禁止访问本安装目录下的 conf，例如安装到 /opds/：',
  'Only configuration requires protection here; direct book downloads remain allowed. HTTPS probes verify the base URL and configuration protection before storing credentials. The server needs HTTPS self-access with a trusted certificate.' => '这里仅保护配置目录，不要求限制书籍文件的直接访问。安装器通过 HTTPS 探针核对网址和配置保护，通过后才写凭据；需要服务器能通过有效证书访问自身。',
  'PHP needs ZIP, DOM, SimpleXML, session, filter, and zlib. HTTPS probes need OpenSSL and allow_url_fopen. Forward HTTPS to PHP and HTTP_AUTHORIZATION to index.php and api.php. Allow uploads up to 205 MiB at up.php and api.php. Setup needs at least two PHP workers for its HTTPS checks.' => 'PHP 需要 ZIP、DOM、SimpleXML、session、filter 和 zlib。HTTPS 检查需启用 OpenSSL 和 allow_url_fopen。向 PHP 传递 HTTPS，向 index.php 和 api.php 转发 HTTP_AUTHORIZATION。up.php 和 api.php 的请求体限额应至少为 205 MiB。安装时需至少两个 PHP 工作进程完成 HTTPS 检查。',
  'Open OPDS catalog' => '打开 OPDS 目录',
  'Open uploader' => '打开上传页面',
  'Use an absolute installation directory path.' => '请填写安装目录的绝对路径。',
