  'Run these commands on the server, then click Check again. They affect only the named directory.' => '请在服务器执行以下命令，再点击“检查”。命令只修改指定目录。',
  'Choose the absolute server path for the application. Missing directories are created when possible. BASE_URL must serve this directory.' => '填写程序在服务器上的绝对路径；允许时会自动创建不存在的目录。BASE_URL 必须指向此目录。',
  'Password saved for this setup session. Leave both fields blank to keep it.' => '密码已为本次安装暂存，两个密码框都留空即可继续使用，无需重新填写。',
