  'Outside the document root; no conf URL rule is required.' => '位于站点根目录之外，无需配置 conf 禁访规则。',
  'Web application directory' => '网页程序目录',
  'Contains index.php and up.php. BASE_URL points here. Do not enter your private data directory in this field.' => '用于存放 index.php 和 up.php，BASE_URL 指向这里。请不要在此填写独立数据目录。',
  'Storage mode' => '存储模式',
  'Inside the web application directory' => '存放在网页程序目录内',
  'Separate data directory (recommended)' => '独立数据目录（推荐）',
  'Separate data directory' => '独立数据目录',
  'Creates books/ and conf/ here. Choose a path outside the site document root; no Nginx conf-blocking rule is needed for this mode. Do not expose this path through an alias.' => '在此创建 books/ 和 conf/。请选择站点根目录之外的路径，此模式无需 Nginx 的 conf 禁访规则。请勿通过 alias 等方式公开此路径。',
  'The HTTPS URL for index.php and up.php, ending with /. Private books and configuration do not need a public URL.' => 'index.php 和 up.php 所在的 HTTPS 网址，以 / 结尾。私有书籍、配置目录不需要对应网址。',
  'Separate storage outside the document root does not need the conf URL rules below. These rules apply only to storage inside the web application directory.' => '独立数据目录位于站点根目录之外时，无需下方 conf 禁访规则。这些规则仅用于站点内存储。',
  'Checks verify the public web directory over HTTPS. Site storage also requires an HTTP protection check for conf; separate storage instead checks that data paths are outside the document root.' => '检查会通过 HTTPS 验证网页程序目录。站点内存储还需验证 conf 的 HTTP 访问保护；独立存储则验证数据路径确实位于站点根目录之外。',
  'BASE_URL must be the HTTPS URL of the web application directory, without a query string.' => 'BASE_URL 必须是网页程序目录的 HTTPS 地址，不能包含查询参数。',
  'BASE_URL must point to the web application directory, not the separate data directory. HTTPS self-access with a valid certificate is also required.' => 'BASE_URL 必须指向网页程序目录，而不是独立数据目录；服务器还需能通过有效 HTTPS 证书访问此网址。',
  'Web files: ' => '网页程序：',
  'Books: ' => '书籍目录：',
  'Configuration: ' => '配置目录：',
  'Web application directory (automatic)' => '网页程序目录（自动识别）',
  'Detected from install.php. index.php and up.php are generated here; only the data location needs to be chosen.' => '由 install.php 所在位置自动识别，index.php 和 up.php 会生成在这里，只需选择数据存放位置。',
  'Use an absolute data directory path.' => '请填写数据目录的绝对路径。',
  'The data directory path contains an invalid component.' => '数据目录路径包含无效的目录段。',
  'The data directory path must not contain symbolic links or files.' => '数据目录路径不能包含符号链接或普通文件。',
  'PHP cannot set read/enter-only permissions (0550) on the book directory: ' => 'PHP 无法将书籍目录设为只读、可进入（0550）：',
